
# Surfing-ReportBlock
# Category: Analytics
# Purpose: Application analytics and usage statistics
#
# Mihomo rule format: classical
#
# Safety policy:
# 1. Only add verified analytics and tracking domains.
# 2. Preserve crash reporting when required by applications.
# 3. Do not block login, payment or authentication services.
# 4. Do not block push notifications or DNS services.
# 5. Do not block banking, gaming or system services.
#
# Candidate review policy:
# Candidate entries below are comments only.
# They do NOT create active Mihomo blocking rules.
# Do not uncomment until source verification and device testing are complete.
#
# --------------------------------------------------
# HeyTap / OPPO telemetry candidates
# Origin: User-provided hosts configuration
# Independent upstream verification: Pending
# Device observation: Pending
#
