# Purpose: Possible system telemetry / reporting endpoint
# Risk: Medium; actual function requires verification
#
# Candidate: metrics.heytap.com
# Purpose: Possible metrics collection endpoint
# Risk: Medium; actual function requires verification
#
# Candidate: log.heytap.com
# Purpose: Possible system log reporting endpoint
# Risk: Medium; may affect diagnostic reporting
#
# Candidate: log.oppomobile.com
